   "By 1900 only Siam, which modernised and played Britain off against France, remained independent. Colonial rule brought plantations, forced cultivation and new nationalist movements. "
   "Japan's conquest in 1941-42 broke European authority, and after 1945 the region won independence through negotiation or war, from Indonesia to Vietnam. "
